ss&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRlSV6iSWUUQ7kNvwEMYqbl&_nc_oc=AdrR0Yc98ysOSBtsGreMB8LSgzEjHhYXgBIMcjP9VPoZtrSmAQ--o7pw0Ls8TEgTrds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIhwolgdmrfHw9C0B8ONg8fGqDlYdg71jd7NlcAXTiiw&oe=6AFC8FCA"}, {"file_name": "buggy.png", "id": "1627087928239307", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031529_1627087931572640_4083118609254979821_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D8-6doCl0ukQ7kNvwHNXr4a&_nc_oc=AdpJraorRLFljB4fP7-JHNh-ZQt3HuPSkDhhQwutsOz0Gt9EZVarp0Afohr1B0OfWmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2V6L4OrGg8eb8VE6TSflh_Ub4PFvG6M-o1e9XVaVXRQ&oe=6AFC7980"}, {"file_name": "bowling_escavation.png", "id": "1076453430688828", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974746_1076453434022161_3902000793864200888_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rm1bueie0j8Q7kNvwHOo3aP&_nc_oc=Ado66qHQyPet3Q2coomgVVveKUrAdGy5IHBCNYyHsw9YahcPiRxi9d_DcW_ZIDgARMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzKaPDILpHxIqwUXgdsAvgYEeTUBiz3v9nQJl9u0KkvA&oe=6AFC834F"}, {"file_name": "asteroid_scanning.png", "id": "1708518839722580", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75303839_1708518843055913_8867692545714880265_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ONJmrI8xFmMQ7kNvwFZimzl&_nc_oc=Adq6awQx_ZIXHUhG_42EAOJNA6B1n3h1jjiV-H7f-VRKf7d1ofa3RGnpPs3_cPhx-Eo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-xLWGOOnereqoSn8mYor3NkQxwVKc4t_sl2rUlIHm4Q&oe=6AFC874D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_ASP_CoverImage.png", "id": "865693635411839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031309_865693638745172_2747540183598569721_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z67sB2gefSMQ7kNvwHYz3Or&_nc_oc=AdoW-qgWmCKLaSXa2OUMMgVdhtmJf9vCRfbcoIRT23qU6Ia9kE1133PtccXedE9djRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxwaXbgwkCu2hJ7zRHCQQuSJdFJcz0ap1PnfZhXrYs9g&oe=6AFC71CD"}, "display_name": "A Space Pawdyssey", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Embark on A Space Pawdyssey!\n\nYou play **Astra**, a smart, sweet and ambitious husky, sent on a space exploration mission by the human-led organization called PAWSA.\n\nAstra is joined by a quirky team of companions **SBURD**, a deranged goose that only communicates through honks and unsettling stares; **Albert the XV**, a cynical and well-educated monkey, that is also the team\u2019s weapon expert; and **Luna**, an adorable, but slightly neurotic mouse suffering from space allergies and a massive crush on the goose.\n{949438840336802}\n\n\n The team is tasked with traveling to two mysterious planets to collect three vital ingredients for analysis, providing insights into newly discovered celestial bodies. \n{606909931764369}\n\n\nAlong the way, they face a series of **wild adventures** and **chaotic disasters**: \n{413392028505368}\n\nLuna gets launched across the first planet by an uncontrollable sneezing fit, a **meteor shower** pummels the second planet, and a **space battle** erupts with French cat astronauts. \n\nFrom **reactor reboots** to electrical malfunctions and the unclogging of the ship\u2019s engines after a vicious **chicken \"bowel movement\" attack**, this crew has to master it all.\n\n{549656377922356}\nThese adrenaline-packed challenges are paired with fun **puzzle** and **rhythm-based** mini-games, which serve as the key to experimenting with the collected ingredients.\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Join the space pack and embark on a high-stakes cosmic adventure: Battle meteor storms, rival feline-astronauts, and chaotic mishaps like sneezing fits and questionable chicken sabotage. Solve puzzles, play rhythm mini-games, and explore newly discovered planets!!"}]}, "developer_name"